1. Create project folder (VM workspace)
• mkdir fastapi
• cd fastapi

2. Create virtual environment (VM)
• python -m venv venv

3. Activate virtual environment

• Windows:
  • venv\Scripts\activate

• Mac/Linux:
  • source venv/bin/activate

4. Upgrade pip
• python -m pip install --upgrade pip

5. Install dependencies
• pip install fastapi uvicorn

6. Confirm installation
• pip list

Check:
• fastapi
• uvicorn

7. Create project file
• Inside fastapi/:
  • touch main.py

8. Final structure
• fastapi/
  ├── venv/
  └── main.py
